{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:17 2026-05-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:17 2026-05-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:17 2026-05-14 HKT</p><p>大埔宏福苑五級大火未波及的宏志閣，繼續有居民返回單位執拾，今日（14日）是第二日。有住戶坦言在宏福苑居住數十載，充滿感情，不捨得離開，需再考慮是否出售業權。</p><p>現場所見，居民先到廣福社區會堂登記，然後上樓。不少人帶備行李篋及紙皮箱等，亦有人執拾後乘坐穿梭巴士離開。</p><img alt=\"居民上樓執拾後乘坐穿梭巴士離開。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/71bef2ccfa540575fbbd7138493c0f42/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103129172_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e0c791eda0baefc3e39e222a0089bf90/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103129172_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"宏志閣居民第二日上樓執拾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07752b7fad4fc055c99b8d91e821c8fd/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103129172.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ec889af7012e0f41785288a4a51f7978/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103146248.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/30a8eeb2bdfa9fd91d7ef14a8600636f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103146248_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8fd7596b277962141cf29cbef44af9fc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_103212633.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T07:25:51.020145+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}